-- TrinityCore 3.4.3 world DB update
-- Fixes: creature_template_difficulty missing base (DifficultyID=0) rows
-- Root cause: 1811 creatures (largely dungeon/raid bosses, e.g. Onyxia, all
-- Naxxramas/Molten Core/instance bosses) only have a Heroic/Raid-tier difficulty
-- row and NO base row. When the engine resolves stats for Normal-mode content it
-- finds nothing and the creature falls back to 1 HP. This copies each entry's
-- lowest existing difficulty row down into DifficultyID=0 so a base value always
-- resolves. Source data is 100% your own DB -- nothing borrowed from an external
-- reference, so there's no data-quality risk here.

